#!/bin/sh
# BeamNG.drive (Windows ARM64 build in /opt/beamng) under aarch64 Wine (/opt/wine, tools/wine-cross.sh),
# Wine's Wayland driver, the game's own Vulkan renderer on RADV. Run as the desktop user.
export WINEPREFIX=${WINEPREFIX:-$HOME/.wine-beamng} WINEDLLOVERRIDES=mscoree,mshtml= WINEDEBUG=${WINEDEBUG:-err+all,fixme-all}
export PATH=/opt/wine/bin:$PATH
if [ ! -d "$WINEPREFIX" ]; then
	wineboot -i && wine reg add 'HKCU\Software\Wine\Drivers' /v Graphics /d wayland /f && wineserver -w
fi
cd /opt/beamng/BinArm64
exec xclipse-env wine BeamNG.drive.arm64.exe -gfx vk "$@"
